# PAS — Health Assessment Platform

[فارسی](README.fa.md) · **English**

PAS (Persian: «پاس», _Platform for Health Assessment_) is a Persian-first healthcare workflow application designed to connect patients, physicians, laboratories, and platform administrators around a structured care process. The interface is right-to-left (RTL) by default and uses the Vazirmatn typeface.

> **Project status:** Active development. The repository contains application workflows and Supabase integrations, but production readiness, clinical validation, regulatory compliance, and end-to-end security must be assessed independently before real patient data is used.

